  "summary": "The paper compares QAOA, Sampling VQE, and Exact Minimum Eigen Solver on a 20-stock NSE portfolio optimization task against classical MVO, GA, and SA baselines. Reported errors in Table I show QAOA achieving the best MSE (0.005), followed by Exact MES (0.006) and Sampling VQE (0.007), while the best classical method, GA, has MSE 0.0105 and MVO/SA are much worse (0.946 and 0.65 MSE, respectively).",
